      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKET ROSIE (2) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 9 lengths back in third (23.44) at this track in a Maiden over 401m. One of the contenders. SHUT THE SHOP (1) is a first starter from the Peter Ray kennel by Shima Shine out of Dancer On Fire. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Respect any strong moves in the market. HALF A GO (3) is a handily bred pup making her debut without a trial. Can sneak into the finish on debut. DANI DEE WHY (7) is an Alan Proctor-trained newcomer by Jackslittlething out of It's Party Time. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Market should provide a lead to her ability.",
